{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495899,"name":"Carter Ventucci","username":"Carter-Ventucci","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/dec6dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:15:20.781Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot account has been unusable since approximately September 7.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer is reachable and my existing bot roster and conversation history load, but every bot fails when I try to send a message. The problem occurs on both my Windows desktop and iPhone and affects every bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy original support case was T-F61261. The current support case is T-F65125.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn September 10, the automated support response said the issue had been passed to a teammate and that someone would follow up. No teammate has contacted me. I have followed up several times since then.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLater support/feedback tickets were closed as duplicates of T-F65125, so I do not want to create another support ticket. I am posting here because the existing case appears to be stuck in the automated support loop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy account has active SuperGrok-linked Grok Bot access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on desktop or iPhone.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen any existing bot or conversation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a message.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe bot fails to respond.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRepeat with another bot and the same failure occurs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer itself remains reachable and existing bots/history are visible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessages sent to my Grok Bot agents should reach the existing Agent Computer/runtime and receive normal responses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI would like the existing Agent Computer/runtime inspected and repaired or reattached on the backend without another Reset if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.11.1 (11669) ios\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditional context:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis issue has persisted for nearly two weeks and I have had no working Grok Bot agents during that time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport case T-F65125 is still the active case. I was told on September 10 that it had been passed to a teammate, but I have not received a follow-up from that teammate. Later support contacts were closed as duplicates of the same case.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA previous Reset/recovery attempt left the Agent Computer in a partial state, so I would prefer that the existing runtime/computer be inspected on the backend before another Reset is attempted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am happy to provide the account email, exact error screenshots, request IDs, app/browser versions, or any other diagnostics privately if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T19:15:30.424Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":35.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172368,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-computer-reachable-but-all-bots-fail-t-f65125","display_username":"Carter Ventucci","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138795,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/gr